In the northwestern Sicilian town of Alcamo, many locals believed that Franca Viola's beauty was destined to lift her family out of poverty. Despite all the fanfare regarding her looks, Franca was an unassuming 15-year-old. She aspired to complete her education, live a comfortable life and travel the world. She also dreamed of falling in love. Unlike Franca Viola, whose family were poor farmers, Filippo Melodia was born into wealth. He was the nephew of the undisputed boss of the Casa Nostra, the Sicilian mafia. Filippo enjoyed all of the privileges that such an association offered.
在西西里西北部的小镇阿尔卡莫，许多当地人认为弗兰卡·维奥拉的美貌注定能让她的家庭摆脱贫困。尽管外界对她的美貌大肆渲染，但弗兰卡只是一个谦逊的 15 岁女孩。她渴望完成学业，过上舒适的生活，并环游世界。她也梦想着坠入爱河。与家庭贫困的农民弗兰卡·维奥拉不同，菲利波·梅洛迪亚出生于富裕家庭。他是西西里黑手党“卡萨诺斯特拉”（Cosa Nostra）无可争议的老大的侄子。菲利波享受着这种关系所带来的所有特权。

6
00:04:26.000 --> 00:05:04.000
